      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Plano caps rear fences at 8 feet, wants front-yard fences under 40 inches and half open, and most subdivisions add an HOA on top. Call now and compare two or three written quotes from independent fence contractors.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
